{{Classic Era}}
The '''Quest Journal''' tracks Task-system quests and objectives in EverQuest Legends. By default, press '''Alt+Q''' to open it.

The launch-day redesign of [[Kerra Island|Kerra Isle]] uses this Task system for its new-character quests.

